@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About</PageTitle>

<div class="container">
    
    <h1>About the project</h1>
    
    <p> This application demonstrates a simple project management approach focused on clear
        prioritization and iterative progress. Projects are organized by importance, allowing
        teams to quickly identify what requires immediate attention and what can be planned
        for later stages of development.</p>
    
    <p> The priority board helps development teams visualize workload, adjust priorities
        dynamically, and maintain focus on high-impact tasks. By enabling easy reordering
        of projects, the board supports agile thinking, improves communication, and encourages
        efficient decision-making throughout the development lifecycle.</p>

</div>

